 "notes": "All six old kinds kept. Models that belong to archetypes (Arcadia Pro T5 kit and Desert 12% lamp, Zoo Med ReptiSun T5 HO, Arcadia Deep Heat Projector, Zoo Med CHE, Habistat Dimming Thermostat) moved into x versions. UVB lamp trimmed 19 -> 12 flat models (dropped near-duplicate Exo Terra UVB100/200 variants and ReptiSun Mini Compact). Dropped repeated 'Exo Terra reptile range' and the three Arcadia Desert/Forest/Shade Dweller r ranges (now covered by ProT5 lamp strengths). New kind Thermometer and hygrometer (Exo Terra Combometer source). Not added for lack of a retrieved page: Zoo Med CE-60/CE-150 wattages, Arcadia D3 100/160 W and D3EVO, Microclimate Evo Lite, Arcadia Jungle Dawn LED, Solarmeter UV meters. Brand countries/founding years left blank where not confirmed."
